      "notes": "What an actor says when they react to an act in public. {act} names the act ('the arrest order').",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "support.warm.1",
          "text": "{act} was the right call, and I'll say so to anyone.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "praise",
              "defend_publicly",
              "support_publicly",
              "close_ranks",
              "rally_votes",
              "frame_favourably"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "support.warm.2",
          "text": "On {act}, this administration has my full support.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "praise",
              "defend_publicly",
              "support_publicly",
              "close_ranks",
              "rally_votes",
              "frame_favourably"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "support.warm.3",
          "text": "Say what you like. {act} was the right thing to do.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "praise",
              "defend_publicly",
              "support_publicly",
              "close_ranks",
              "rally_votes",
              "frame_favourably"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "support.warm.folksy.1",
          "text": "I back the President on {act}. It's that simple.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "praise",
              "defend_publicly",
              "support_publicly",
              "close_ranks",
              "rally_votes",
              "frame_favourably"
            ]
          },
          "voice": [
            "Folksy",
            "Blunt"
          ],
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "support.warm.formal.1",
          "text": "I commend the President for {act}. It was a responsible decision.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "praise",
              "defend_publicly",
              "support_publicly",
              "close_ranks",
              "rally_votes",
              "frame_favourably"
            ]
          },
          "voice": [
            "Formal",
            "Diplomatic"
          ],
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "frame_favourably.warm.1",
          "text": "Tonight's verdict: {act} was the right call.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "frame_favourably"
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "foreign_support.warm.1",
          "text": "{speaker_country} stands with our friends in {player_country}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "statement_of_support",
              "statement_of_confidence",
              "offer_assistance"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "foreign_support.warm.2",
          "text": "We have full confidence in {player_country} and its institutions.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "statement_of_support",
              "statement_of_confidence",
              "offer_assistance"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "foreign_support.warm.3",
          "text": "We are ready to help {player_country} in any way we can.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "statement_of_support",
              "statement_of_confidence",
              "offer_assistance"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "foreign_support.warm.nationalist.1",
          "text": "{speaker_country} honours its friendships, and {player_country} is a friend.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "statement_of_support",
              "statement_of_confidence",
              "offer_assistance"
            ]
          },
          "voice": [
            "Nationalist"
          ],
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "foreign_support.warm.folksy.1",
          "text": "When a friend's in trouble, you show up. We're showing up for {player_country}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "statement_of_support",
              "statement_of_confidence",
              "offer_assistance"
            ]
          },
          "voice": [
            "Folksy"
          ],
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "foreign_support.warm.folksy.2",
          "text": "We've got {player_country}'s back. Always have.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "statement_of_support",
              "statement_of_confidence",
              "offer_assistance"
            ]
          },
          "voice": [
            "Folksy"
          ],
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "foreign_support.warm.formal.1",
          "text": "On behalf of my government, I reaffirm our commitment to {player_country}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "statement_of_support",
              "statement_of_confidence",
              "offer_assistance"
            ]
          },
          "voice": [
            "Formal",
            "Diplomatic"
          ],
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "foreign_support.warm.formal.2",
          "text": "My government has every confidence that {player_country} will meet this moment.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "statement_of_support",
              "statement_of_confidence",
              "offer_assistance"
            ]
          },
          "voice": [
            "Formal",
            "Diplomatic"
          ],
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "bipartisan_outreach.warm.1",
          "text": "This is bigger than party. I'm ready to work with the White House.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "bipartisan_outreach"
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "bipartisan_outreach.warm.2",
          "text": "Let's find common ground. My door is open to both sides.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "bipartisan_outreach"
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "bipartisan_outreach.warm.folksy.1",
          "text": "Americans want us to work together, and on this we can.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "bipartisan_outreach"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Folksy"
          ],
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "express_concern.cold.1",
          "text": "I have serious concerns about {act}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "express_concern"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "express_concern.cold.2",
          "text": "{act} raises questions that deserve answers.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "express_concern"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "express_concern.cold.formal.1",
          "text": "We note {act} with concern and will follow developments closely.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "express_concern"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Formal",
            "Diplomatic"
          ],
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "demand_concession.cold.1",
          "text": "We'll go along, but we expect something in return.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "demand_concession"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "demand_concession.cold.2",
          "text": "Our support has a price, and the White House knows what it is.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "demand_concession"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "demand_concession.cold.3",
          "text": "Before we say more about {act}, we want to talk terms.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "demand_concession"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "criticize.cold.1",
          "text": "{act} was a mistake, and the White House should own it.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "criticize",
              "distance_from_leader"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "criticize.cold.2",
          "text": "I can't defend {act}, and I won't try.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "criticize",
              "distance_from_leader"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "criticize.cold.blunt.1",
          "text": "Wrong call. {act} will cost the country.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "criticize",
              "distance_from_leader"
            ]
          },
          "voice": [
            "Blunt",
            "Folksy",
            "Combative"
          ],
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "rebuke_publicly.cold.1",
          "text": "We expected better from {player_country}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "rebuke_publicly"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "rebuke_publicly.cold.2",
          "text": "{speaker_country} regrets {act} and urges Washington to reconsider.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "rebuke_publicly"
              },
              {
                "not": {
                  "kind": "economy"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "rebuke_publicly.cold.3",
          "text": "{act} is not the act of a reliable partner.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "rebuke_publicly"
              },
              {
                "not": {
                  "kind": "economy"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "economy.rebuke_publicly.cold.1",
          "text": "{player_country} has let its own crisis get out of hand.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "rebuke_publicly"
              },
              {
                "kind": "economy"
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "economy.rebuke_publicly.cold.2",
          "text": "A great power should be able to pay its bills.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "rebuke_publicly"
              },
              {
                "kind": "economy"
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "summon_ambassador.cold.1",
          "text": "We have summoned the ambassador of {player_country} to explain {act}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "summon_ambassador"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "summon_ambassador.cold.2",
          "text": "Washington owes us an explanation, and we have asked for one formally.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "summon_ambassador"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "downgrade_cooperation.cold.1",
          "text": "Until Washington explains {act}, our cooperation is on hold.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "downgrade_cooperation"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "downgrade_cooperation.cold.2",
          "text": "We are reviewing every area where we work with {player_country}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "downgrade_cooperation"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "exploit_opening.cold.1",
          "text": "While Washington argues with itself, others will step up.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "exploit_opening"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "exploit_opening.cold.2",
          "text": "The world is watching {player_country} stumble, and so are we.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "exploit_opening"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "reaffirm_oath.cold.1",
          "text": "We serve the Constitution, not any one person.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "reaffirm_oath"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "reaffirm_oath.cold.2",
          "text": "Our oath is to the Constitution. Every officer knows what that means.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "reaffirm_oath"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "obstruct.cold.1",
          "text": "Until we get answers on {act}, the White House shouldn't count on my vote.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "withhold_votes",
              "hold_nominees",
              "introduce_blocking_bill",
              "cut_funding"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "obstruct.cold.2",
          "text": "I'm placing a hold on the administration's nominees.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "withhold_votes",
              "hold_nominees",
              "introduce_blocking_bill",
              "cut_funding"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "obstruct.cold.3",
          "text": "We're introducing a bill to stop {act} in its tracks.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "withhold_votes",
              "hold_nominees",
              "introduce_blocking_bill",
              "cut_funding"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "obstruct.cold.4",
          "text": "Not one dollar for this.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "withhold_votes",
              "hold_nominees",
              "introduce_blocking_bill",
              "cut_funding"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "oversight.cold.1",
          "text": "The American people deserve answers on {act}. We want hearings.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "demand_hearings",
              "issue_subpoenas",
              "demand_special_counsel"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "oversight.cold.2",
          "text": "We will issue subpoenas. Nobody is above the law.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "demand_hearings",
              "issue_subpoenas",
              "demand_special_counsel"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "oversight.cold.3",
          "text": "This needs an independent investigation. We are calling for a special counsel.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "demand_hearings",
              "issue_subpoenas",
              "demand_special_counsel"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "break_with_party.cold.1",
          "text": "I can't follow my party's leader on this. I'm breaking ranks.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "break_with_party"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "break_with_party.cold.2",
          "text": "On {act}, my conscience comes before my party.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "break_with_party"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "joint_letter.cold.1",
          "text": "Along with my colleagues, I've written to the President about {act}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "joint_letter"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "sue_over_dismissal.cold.1",
          "text": "My dismissal was unlawful, and I'll prove it in court.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "sue_over_dismissal"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "sue_over_dismissal.cold.2",
          "text": "I was fired for doing my job. A judge will hear about it.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "sue_over_dismissal"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "lawsuit.cold.1",
          "text": "We are taking {act} to court.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "file_lawsuit",
              "seek_injunction",
              "state_lawsuit"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "lawsuit.cold.2",
          "text": "We have asked the court to halt {act} at once.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "file_lawsuit",
              "seek_injunction",
              "state_lawsuit"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "lawsuit.cold.3",
          "text": "Our state will not stand by. We are suing.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "file_lawsuit",
              "seek_injunction",
              "state_lawsuit"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "file_amicus_brief.cold.1",
          "text": "We've filed a brief supporting the challenge to {act}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "file_amicus_brief"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "judicial_rebuke.cold.1",
          "text": "No official, however senior, may ignore the law. This court will not look away.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "judicial_rebuke"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "judicial_rebuke.cold.academic.1",
          "text": "The law binds the government as it binds everyone else.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "judicial_rebuke"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Academic",
            "Formal"
          ],
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "investigate_story.cold.1",
          "text": "Our reporters are looking into {act}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "investigate_story"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "investigate_story.cold.2",
          "text": "We are asking questions about {act}, and we will publish what we find.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "investigate_story"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "editorial_against.cold.1",
          "text": "Our view: {act} was wrong, and the President must answer for it.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "editorial_against"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "editorial_against.cold.2",
          "text": "Editorial: the country deserves better than {act}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "editorial_against"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "warn_markets.cold.1",
          "text": "Markets do not like uncertainty, and {act} creates plenty.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "warn_markets"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "warn_markets.cold.2",
          "text": "Investors are watching {act} closely. So should Washington.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "warn_markets"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "threaten_relocation.cold.1",
          "text": "If this continues, companies will invest elsewhere.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "threaten_relocation"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "defend_independence.cold.1",
          "text": "Our decisions are made on the evidence, not under political pressure.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "defend_independence"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "defend_independence.cold.2",
          "text": "The central bank's independence is not up for negotiation.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "defend_independence"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "campaign.cold.1",
          "text": "Make your voices heard at the ballot box.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "mobilize_voters",
              "fundraise_on_it"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "campaign.cold.2",
          "text": "Stand with us against {act}. Every dollar helps.",
          "when": {
            "decision": [
              "mobilize_voters",
              "fundraise_on_it"
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "condemn.hostile.1",
          "text": "{act} is indefensible. I condemn it without reservation.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "condemn"
          },
          "tone": "Hostile"
        },
        {
          "id": "condemn.hostile.2",
          "text": "There is no excuse for {act}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "condemn"
          },
          "tone": "Hostile"
        },
        {
          "id": "condemn.hostile.formal.1",
          "text": "History will remember {act}, and not kindly.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "condemn"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Formal",
            "Academic"
          ],
          "tone": "Hostile"
        },
        {
          "id": "condemn_internationally.hostile.1",
          "text": "{speaker_country} condemns {act} in the strongest terms.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "condemn_internationally"
          },
          "tone": "Hostile"
        },
        {
          "id": "condemn_internationally.hostile.2",
          "text": "What Washington has done is a danger to us all.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "condemn_internationally"
          },
          "tone": "Hostile"
        },
        {
          "id": "recall_ambassador.hostile.1",
          "text": "We are recalling our ambassador from Washington for consultations.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "recall_ambassador"
          },
          "tone": "Hostile"
        },
        {
          "id": "recall_ambassador.hostile.2",
          "text": "Our ambassador is coming home until Washington explains itself.",
          "when": {
